    "updated_at": "2025-06-16T06:45:59Z",
    "body": "I'm still in favor of attempting to eliminate 1 in favor of 2 and making 2 easier for specification authors. Both of these also seem like fairly straightforward refactoring projects that are a good way for someone to get familiar with the standardization and implementation process.",
